<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal extends guarantee for Lisnave.</title>
<headline>Portugal extends guarantee for Lisnave.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Portuguese cabinet has extended a state guarantee on a 3.5 billion escudos loan for struggling ship repairer Lisnave, a statement said.</p>
<p>&quot;The cabinet approved a resolution extending a guarantee by the state for a loan of 3.5 billion escudos, contracted by Lisnave from Banco Totta &amp; Acores,&quot; the cabinet said.</p>
<p>The statement did not give the original term of the guarantee and gave no further details.</p>
<p>Lisnave shares ended unchanged at 234 escudos in volume of 24,816 shares on Lisbon bourse.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +351-1-3538254</p>
</text>
